{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" xmlns:datamodel=\"https://github.com/stateforward/scxml.rs/namespaces/datamodel\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" datamodel:srcexpr=\"'https://github.com/o/r/datamodels/json'\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\" datamodel:src=\"https://github.com/o/r/datamodels/json\">\n    <transition event=\"go\" target=\"done\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/datamodel001-misplaced-src.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":2,"notes":0,"total":2,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/datamodel001-misplaced-src.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":225,"endLine":1,"startColumn":165,"startLine":1}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`datamodel:srcexpr` is not an attribute of the `datamodel` vocabulary\n\n**Note:** the `datamodel` vocabulary has exactly one attribute: `datamodel:src`, the URI of the data model's package\n\n**Help:** use `datamodel:src`, or remove the attribute","text":"`datamodel:srcexpr` is not an attribute of the `datamodel` vocabulary"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":224,"start":164},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"DATAMODEL001"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/datamodel001-misplaced-src.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":55,"byteOffset":253,"endColumn":71,"endLine":2,"startColumn":16,"startLine":2},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove `datamodel:src`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/datamodel001-misplaced-src.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":71,"endLine":2,"startColumn":17,"startLine":2}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`datamodel:src` is not allowed on `<state>`\n\n**Note:** only `<scxml>` names a data model (SCXML 1.0 §3.2.1), so only `<scxml>` may name its package; an invoked document declares its own `datamodel` and `datamodel:src`\n\n**Help:** move the attribute to the `<scxml>` whose data model it names, or remove it","text":"`datamodel:src` is not allowed on `<state>`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":308,"start":254},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"DATAMODEL001"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"`https://github.com/stateforward/scxml.rs/namespaces/datamodel` is the host's attribute vocabulary for naming a data model's package: it defines exactly one attribute, `datamodel:src` on `<scxml>`, the only element that names a data model (SCXML 1.0 §3.2.1). It has no elements and no other attributes (an expression cannot select a data model: it needs one to be evaluated in), and an invoked document declares its own pair. The W3C schema admits attributes in other namespaces laxly, so only this rule catches a misplaced or misspelled one"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: move `datamodel:src` to the `<scxml>` whose data model it names, correct its name, or remove it.\n\nRun `scx --explain DATAMODEL001` for examples."},"id":"DATAMODEL001","name":"DATAMODEL001","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"the `datamodel` namespace is used outside `<scxml>`'s `datamodel:src`"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}